com/i/185789779?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1d7da03a-b16b-4f94-b518-b9d42aa24579_1452x672.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hCpo!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1d7da03a-b16b-4f94-b518-b9d42aa24579_1452x672.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hCpo!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1d7da03a-b16b-4f94-b518-b9d42aa24579_1452x672.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hCpo!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1d7da03a-b16b-4f94-b518-b9d42aa24579_1452x672.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hCpo!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1d7da03a-b16b-4f94-b518-b9d42aa24579_1452x672.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Better.  Gulp.  Ok, that is a one off, I’m sure.  </p><p>I’ll check the homepage of a peer reviewed journal, like <strong>The Journal of Clinical Psychiatry (JCP)</strong>:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BZPn!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2542350d-89a2-436a-b632-25a583ae447b_1452x672.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BZPn!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2542350d-89a2-436a-b632-25a583ae447b_1452x672.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BZPn!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2542350d-89a2-436a-b632-25a583ae447b_1452x672.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BZPn!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2542350d-89a2-436a-b632-25a583ae447b_1452x672.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BZPn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2542350d-89a2-436a-b632-25a583ae447b_1452x672.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BZPn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2542350d-89a2-436a-b632-25a583ae447b_1452x672.png\" width=\"367\" height=\"169.8512396694215\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2542350d-89a2-436a-b632-25a583ae447b_1452x672.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:672,&quot;width&quot;:1452,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:367,&quot;bytes&quot;:100410,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/i/185789779?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2542350d-89a2-436a-b632-25a583ae447b_1452x672.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BZPn!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2542350d-89a2-436a-b632-25a583ae447b_1452x672.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BZPn!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2542350d-89a2-436a-b632-25a583ae447b_1452x672.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BZPn!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2542350d-89a2-436a-b632-25a583ae447b_1452x672.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BZPn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2542350d-89a2-436a-b632-25a583ae447b_1452x672.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Well, I guess it's better again. But psychiatrist.com is just a really good domain name.  I'm sure if I look at the most institutional source of knowledge on the Internet about psychiatry, the American psychiatric Association own website for publishing content from the DSM-5-TR, the American Journal of Psychiatry, and associated resources, it would definitely rank higher than my newsletter?</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!viJ1!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7214a29f-7746-4689-9f4b-7cb8c74fb417_1383x568.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!viJ1!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7214a29f-7746-4689-9f4b-7cb8c74fb417_1383x568.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!viJ1!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7214a29f-7746-4689-9f4b-7cb8c74fb417_1383x568.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!viJ1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7214a29f-7746-4689-9f4b-7cb8c74fb417_1383x568.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!viJ1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7214a29f-7746-4689-9f4b-7cb8c74fb417_1383x568.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!viJ1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7214a29f-7746-4689-9f4b-7cb8c74fb417_1383x568.png\" width=\"553\" height=\"227.117859725235\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/7214a29f-7746-4689-9f4b-7cb8c74fb417_1383x568.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:568,&quot;width&quot;:1383,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:553,&quot;bytes&quot;:80913,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/i/185789779?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa24b85eb-ca7c-4cde-aadc-4775eeb4fe1d_1390x672.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!viJ1!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7214a29f-7746-4689-9f4b-7cb8c74fb417_1383x568.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!viJ1!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7214a29f-7746-4689-9f4b-7cb8c74fb417_1383x568.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!viJ1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7214a29f-7746-4689-9f4b-7cb8c74fb417_1383x568.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!viJ1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7214a29f-7746-4689-9f4b-7cb8c74fb417_1383x568.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>But it does…not.  This is awkward. </p><p>Humans of the Internet, this newsletter has arrived.  It may not have the most traffic, it may not be completely serious all the time, but it has the Internet compared to most things I could think to check.  I'm not saying this newsletter Won the Internet come up, but I've got a higher rating than NEJM:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fKla!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbd3be4c0-e997-4ac2-9502-8640f4654271_1390x560.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fKla!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbd3be4c0-e997-4ac2-9502-8640f4654271_1390x560.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fKla!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbd3be4c0-e997-4ac2-9502-8640f4654271_1390x560