images%2Fbd3be4c0-e997-4ac2-9502-8640f4654271_1390x560.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fKla!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbd3be4c0-e997-4ac2-9502-8640f4654271_1390x560.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fKla!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbd3be4c0-e997-4ac2-9502-8640f4654271_1390x560.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>I’m confused.  At least the NY Times homepage beats me…by one point.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jkks!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc0f396ab-73c3-4a1a-af31-8ac452e740b9_1390x560.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jkks!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc0f396ab-73c3-4a1a-af31-8ac452e740b9_1390x560.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jkks!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc0f396ab-73c3-4a1a-af31-8ac452e740b9_1390x560.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jkks!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc0f396ab-73c3-4a1a-af31-8ac452e740b9_1390x560.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jkks!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc0f396ab-73c3-4a1a-af31-8ac452e740b9_1390x560.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jkks!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc0f396ab-73c3-4a1a-af31-8ac452e740b9_1390x560.png\" width=\"506\" height=\"203.85611510791367\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/c0f396ab-73c3-4a1a-af31-8ac452e740b9_1390x560.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:560,&quot;width&quot;:1390,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:506,&quot;bytes&quot;:81218,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/i/185789779?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc0f396ab-73c3-4a1a-af31-8ac452e740b9_1390x560.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jkks!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc0f396ab-73c3-4a1a-af31-8ac452e740b9_1390x560.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jkks!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc0f396ab-73c3-4a1a-af31-8ac452e740b9_1390x560.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jkks!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc0f396ab-73c3-4a1a-af31-8ac452e740b9_1390x560.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jkks!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc0f396ab-73c3-4a1a-af31-8ac452e740b9_1390x560.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>The Internet is weird. But consistency does pay off.  Thanks for reading, feel free to share your thoughts in the comments.  I could just be doing the search wrong?</p><p>See you all in the coming week!</p><p></p><p>Addendum: that math is based on SUBSTACK, not just me.  Trombones getting sad:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3Yi0!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe7c22a32-b2b1-4726-80d2-755a7bdaac79_1231x761.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3Yi0!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe7c22a32-b2b1-4726-80d2-755a7bdaac79_1231x761.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3Yi0!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe7c22a32-b2b1-4726-80d2-755a7bdaac79_1231x761.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3Yi0!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe7c22a32-b2b1-4726-80d2-755a7bdaac79_1231x761.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3Yi0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe7c22a32-b2b1-4726-80d2-755a7bdaac79_1231x761.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3Yi0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2